## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal policy evaluation sketch
function evaluatePolicy(tenantId, prompt) {
  const policy = fetchPolicy(tenantId);
  if (policy.blockedKeywords?.some(k => prompt.includes(k))) return false;
  return true;
}
```

